<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>bugle and drummer spam</Major>
    <Description>No more minigames for drumming or trumpetting bonuses, now you can skip all this by simply setting this command to repeat when pressed, it will automatically play the bugle or trumpet for you in Die of Death when you execute it after the ability starts its minigame.</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 20 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 8 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 21 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 21 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 23 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 23 1
Delay 64
KeyDown 9 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 9 1
Delay 64</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>